Every clinician should review a care-access-consideration before an opioid-initiation.
Every clinician should review a care-access-consideration before an opioid-continuation.
Every clinician should review a care-access-consideration before a pain-treatment-initiation.
Every clinician should review a care-access-consideration before a pain-treatment-continuation.
Every opioid-initiation needs a clinical-oversight.
Every opioid-continuation needs a clinical-oversight.
Every pain-treatment-initiation needs a clinical-oversight.
Every pain-treatment-continuation needs a clinical-oversight.
